  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tbsp of oil in a clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add 1 tsp of mustard seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add 1 tsp of ground cumin and 1/2 tsp of red chili powder; sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, cumin powder, coriander powder, and garam masala; sauté for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the kidney beans, 200ml of boiling water, and salt to taste. Stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the heavy cream and stir well. Let it simmer for another 5 minutes.",
    "Serve the Jjigae hot, garnished with a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Serve with naan bread or rice, if desired."
  ],
